OL,3,GNEWSAVehicle thefts now increasingly
OL,4,Acomplex, say police
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police force said vehicle thefts have
OL,7,Fbecome "increasingly complex" after
OL,8,Ffigures showed the amount of reported
OL,9,Fincidents doubled in a decade.
OL,11,FFigures from Cambridgeshire Police,
OL,12,Fobtained by the BBC, showed the number
OL,13,Fof reported vehicle thefts rose from
OL,14,F692 in 2015-16 to 1,464 in 2025-26, an
OL,15,Fincrease of about 111%.
OL,17,FBetween that same period, the number of
OL,18,Fcases resulting in charges had dropped
OL,19,Ffrom 8.4% in 2015-16 to 3.4% in
OL,20,F2025-26.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
