OL,3,GNEWSAVehicle thefts now increasingly
OL,4,Acomplex, say police
OL,5,
OL,6,FA force spokesperson said: "Vehicle
OL,7,Ftheft has become increasingly complex
OL,8,Fover the past decade, with offenders
OL,9,Fusing increasingly sophisticated
OL,10,Ftechniques and organised crime groups
OL,11,Foften operating across force
OL,12,Fboundaries."
